    );
}
```
**Why this matters:** Simplified character loading to use single `adjustToGround()` call, ensuring feet are at Y=0.

### **C:\NajikaCore\digivice\js\kaykit_loader.js** (Referenced for context)

**Purpose:** Handles lazy loading of KayKit 3D assets on demand

**Key Functions:**
